# System Summary
Create a JavaFX standalone desktop app (Java 11, Maven) to manage doctor payments at Galle Cooperative Hospital.
Runs locally on a single Windows PC using embedded H2 database.
Includes: login, doctor registration, patient registration, appointment scheduling, and doctor payment processing.

# Stack
- Java 11 + Maven
- JavaFX for UI
- H2 Embedded DB
- JPA (EclipseLink)
- jpackage for Windows .exe installer
- BCrypt for password hashing

# Entities

## User
- id: Long
- username: String (unique, lowercased)
- passwordHash: String (BCrypt)
- name: String
- role: Enum {ADMIN, CASHIER, AUDITOR}
- isActive: boolean
- createdAt: Instant
- lastLoginAt: Instant

## Doctor
- id: Long
- name: String
- speciality: String
- phone: String
- email: String
- details: String
- isActive: boolean
- createdAt: Instant

## Patient
- id: Long
- name: String
- nic: String (optional)
- phone: String
- dob: LocalDate
- gender: Enum {MALE, FEMALE, OTHER}
- address: String
- createdAt: Instant

## Appointment
- id: Long
- doctor: Doctor
- patient: Patient
- appointmentDateTime: Instant
- status: Enum {SCHEDULED, COMPLETED, CANCELLED}
- createdAt: Instant
- createdBy: User

## DoctorPayment
- id: Long
- receiptId: String (yyyy/dp/00001)
- doctor: Doctor
- description: String
- value: BigDecimal
- paidAt: Instant
- createdAt: Instant
- createdBy: User
- cancelled: boolean
- cancelledBy: User
- cancelledAt: Instant
- cancelReason: String
- printCount: int
- lastPrintedAt: Instant

# Receipt Number Generator
Create receipt_sequence (year INT PK, next_number INT)
Format: yyyy/dp/00001
Atomic update required

# Features

## Login
- On first launch, request username + password → save as ADMIN.
- Secure login thereafter with hashed password.

## Doctor Management
- Add / Edit / View doctors

## Patient Management
- Add / Edit / View patients
- Search by name, NIC, phone

## Appointment Scheduling
- Select doctor + patient
- Choose date/time
- Mark status: Scheduled, Completed, Cancelled
- Appointments viewable per doctor/patient

## Doctor Payments
- Select doctor
- Enter amount, description, date/time
- Generate receipt ID
- Allow print and reprint
- Allow cancel with reason

## Audit + History
- All entities must track who created/edited/cancelled
- Track login timestamps

## UI Screens
- Login
- Home
- Doctor CRUD
- Patient CRUD
- Appointment Scheduler
- Doctor Payment Creation
- Payment List + Search
- Print Preview
- Cancel Payment

## Database
- Embedded H2 (file-based)
- Auto schema generation using JPA
- Save database in `~/AppData/DocPay/db.mv.db`

## Packaging
- Use jpackage to build `.exe` installer
- Include Java runtime
- Offline-capable

# Deliverables
- Maven project
- JavaFX GUI
- Windows installer
- Embedded H2 DB
- README.md with install + usage
